WEBVTT

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:40.470
<i>It is said to have watched over
the history of man since antiquity...</i>

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:46.160
<i>A living witness of the Dark Age...</i>

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:52.620
<i>It is said to have continually defied
the hand of man to remain there...</i>

00:01:53.800 --> 00:02:00.000
<i>Even to this day, in the age
of the Great Kanto Desert...</i>

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:18.590
<i>A rock?</i>

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:21.730
<i>It's no ordinary rock.</i>

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:27.140
<i>You may have heard of it yourself,
it's called "Dog-Girl Rock"...</i>

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:28.410
<i>Dog-Girl Rock?</i>

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:38.200
<i>You know, the one that curses
you if you try to move it...</i>

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:44.120
<i>Now that I look back,
it WAS strangely cheap,</i>

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:47.890
<i>but there's a highway nearby
and it could have water,</i>

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:52.600
<i>so I bought the land that
the Dog-Girl Rock stands on.</i>

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:57.170
<i>So, first I thought I'd try to
get rid of the rock, you know?</i>

00:02:57.170 --> 00:03:00.640
<i>But every single contractor
turned me away.</i>

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:05.040
<i>Desert people do believe
in such superstitions...</i>

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:10.270
<i>I was at my wit's end,
so I offered a reward to volunteers.</i>

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:18.620
<i>Curse, my ass! I'll just use my
super strength to smash it to pieces!</i>

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:20.420
<i>You're so cool, Boss!</i>

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:25.050
<i>It's no match for
the West Oasis' mightiest!</i>

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.110
<i>Boss...</i>

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:40.040
<i>It's the curse!
The curse of the Dog-Girl Rock!</i>

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:46.480
<i>If I just destroy that rock,
we can buy a new home!</i>

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.020
<i>You can do it, Honey!</i>

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.790
<i>I'm hungry, Daddy!</i>

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:52.120
<i>Just hold on!</i>

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:58.490
<i>Honey!</i>

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:00.530
<i>My back!</i>

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.730
<i>- It's the curse!
- Honey!</i>

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:04.600
<i>- The curse of the Dog-Girl Rock!
- I'm hungry!</i>

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.740
<i>Say your prayers, Dog-Girl Rock!</i>

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:16.110
<i>Behold the might of my super battle tank,
Kasumi-chan Mark II!</i>

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:19.820
<i>What?! Engine trouble?!</i>

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.880
<i>W-w-wha?!</i>

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.880
<i>It's the curse!</i>

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.230
<i>I'm scared!</i>

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:37.800
<i>I hired many others,
but they were all gutless cowards...</i>

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:40.340
<i>Is that so?</i>

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.840
<i>I beg you!</i>

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.610
<i>The desert's jack-of-all-trades,
the Handyman Guild,</i>

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:46.210
<i>is my only hope now!</i>

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:49.010
<i>Please! Rid me of that infernal rock!</i>

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.680
<i>Alright, just keep your face away!</i>

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.700
<i>- Dog-Girl Rock?!
- Dog-Girl Rock?!
- Dog-Girl Rock?!</i>

00:04:55.700 --> 00:05:00.590
<i>I know, but he is offering
500,000 per person!</i>

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:03.130
<i>- We'll pass!
- Eh?</i>

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:04.690
<i>But it's 500,000!</i>

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:10.730
<i>It's just that we don't do
dinky jobs like that no more!</i>

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:12.470
<i>It's not that we're afraid!</i>

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:16.500
<i>- Yeah! Not one bit!
- It's just not our thing!</i>

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:18.840
<i>Dog-Girl Rock?!</i>

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:22.080
<i>Yes, he wants it removed...</i>

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.050
<i>My old injury!</i>

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.050
<i>D- D- Dog-Girl Rock?!</i>

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:28.180
<i>He IS offering 500,000...</i>

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:31.990
<i>No can do! I'm not headed that way!</i>

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:34.510
<i>Too bad it wasn't in
a different direction!</i>

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.690
<i>Dog-Girl Rock?!</i>

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:43.770
<i>I'll be killed! I'll be cursed!</i>

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:48.730
<i>"Water Parlor"</i>

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:48.730
Eh? Remove the Dog-Girl Rock?

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:58.880
<i>I was hoping I could
ask you to do it!</i>

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:02.690
<i>Master! Isn't Dog-Girl Rock
that famous one?!</i>

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.950
Huh? It's just a rock.

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:06.960
<i>So you'll do it?!</i>

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:11.260
You hardly need me to do
some paltry job like that!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:14.350
<i>No, but everyone else ran away!</i>

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:17.330
Cowards!

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.930
<i>And...</i>

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.980
<i>...let's not forget recent events.</i>

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:31.780
<i>Your reputation has dropped a bit,</i>

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:35.790
<i>so this is the perfect chance
to let the world know once more</i>

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:41.020
<i>that the Sunabouzu is the
greatest handyman in the West Oasis.</i>

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:43.390
<i>No! In the Great Kanto Desert!</i>

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:45.980
The greatest handyman...

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:52.240
<i>Kan-chan! I mean, Sunabouzu!
You're the only one who can do it!</i>

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:55.240
<i>Ordinary handymen just won't cut it!</i>

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:59.370
<i>Really, you're the
only one I can rely on!</i>

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:05.880
Alright! Though it will be a
super-duper-ultra cinch for me!

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:11.990
<i>It's the curse already!
The curse of the Dog-Girl Rock!</i>

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.360
You idiot! There's no such thing!

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:17.670
Hey, Shopkeeper! Your chairs're crap!

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:19.700
<i>Eh? What happened?</i>

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:27.930
<i>No! It's the curse! The curse!</i>

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.890
<i>- It's just!</i>

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.890
- What's with you?!

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:47.560
Are you still scared?!

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.990
<i>You're not afraid of the curse, Master?!</i>

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.060
Huh?!

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:55.130
<i>I mean, it was created by
arrows and swords during the wars</i>

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:58.000
<i>long before the Dark Age...</i>

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:58.800
So?

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.700
<i>They say it's been cursed ever since,</i>

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:05.240
<i>and that it's remained untouched
for over a thousand years!</i>

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:07.140
Who do you think I am?!

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:10.510
Don't put me in the
same boat as those chickens!

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:18.150
<i>That bastard! Is he calling us chickens?!</i>

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.690
<i>We can't let him beat us, Bro...</i>

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:23.030
<i>But I'm scared!</i>

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:27.100
<i>Imbecile! Think if he
does remove Dog-Girl Rock!</i>

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:31.730
<i>We'll be cowards, he'll be the
ultimate handyman who beat the curse,</i>

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:34.100
<i>and he'll always be better than us!</i>

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:36.670
<i>Yeah, but!</i>

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:39.440
<i>- Let's go! We're gettin' there first!
- Right!</i>

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:44.410
<i>I-I-Is it the curse?!</i>

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:47.540
<i>You clod! There's no such thing!</i>

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:53.310
<i>- Is this...
- Is it...</i>

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:57.290
What's that?!

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:11.810
<i>T-t-the curse!</i>

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:14.780
It's not the stupid curse!

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:18.780
So-called "curses" just scare people
into acting all crazy

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:22.120
and getting hurt and seeing weird stuff!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:23.090
<i>But!</i>

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:24.310
Look!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:29.020
This spot is famous for rockslides.

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:31.960
It's nothing to be worried
about if you're careful,

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:37.370
but since you're focused on curses,
you're prone to walk into danger.

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:40.900
Let's go!

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:43.460
<i>Wait for me!</i>

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:49.340
<i>- It really is the curse!
- You alright, Bro?</i>

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:58.620
<i>You're worried about the curse too,
aren't you, Master?</i>

00:09:58.620 --> 00:09:59.360
Huh?!

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:04.260
<i>You did just walk into danger
because you were worried about it!</i>

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:06.020
I'll have you know!

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:08.930
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:12.920
The air cooler I got
a while ago is acting up...

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.000
<i>Master!</i>

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.870
Damn! I just replaced that stuff!

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:21.000
Dammit! They jipped me!

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:35.420
<i>Master!</i>

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:36.530
<i>It's the...</i>

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.720
It ain't the curse!
It's an ordinary pitfall!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.530
- My stomach!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.530
<i>- Master!</i>

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:50.210
<i>It's the...</i>

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:53.580
It ain't the curse! It was
the water I had this morning!

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:00.680
<i>Master...</i>

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:04.090
No! It ain't the curse!

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.560
<i>I didn't say it was...</i>

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.220
What, then?!

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:12.290
<i>You know why it's called Dog-Girl Rock?</i>

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:13.560
What about it?!

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:16.070
<i>What do you think "Dog-Girl" refers to?</i>

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.590
Hell if I know!

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:23.310
Well, it IS called "Dog-Girl", so...

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:24.570
<i>So?!</i>

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:28.540
Something like this?

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:42.450
<i>Woof!</i>

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:47.960
So irresistible!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:54.440
I-It ain't the curse!
It ain't the curse, got it?!

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.370
<i>You admitted it yourself.</i>

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:57.640
Shut up!

00:11:57.640 --> 00:12:02.300
Let's hurry! Can't just sit around
with my cooler busted!

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:07.020
Come on, Taiko! Let go!
I don't care if you're scared!

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:09.490
Let go already! Come on!

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:13.470
<i>It IS telling us to stay away!</i>

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:18.560
Come on! Come on!

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:30.810
<i>W-w-we're really here!</i>

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:32.780
So that's the Dog-Girl Rock...

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.810
See! I told you it
was just a stupid rock!

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.180
<i>Master! Don't!</i>

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:42.110
This rock ain't so special...

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:48.190
What in the?!

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:56.100
<i>I-I-It's the Dog-Girl!</i>

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:10.340
<i>Oh, this is a rare treat...</i>

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:20.760
<i>- This is the Dog-Girl?
- No!</i>

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:24.260
You! What is Repo Man Amagumo
doing here?!

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:25.530
<i>Amagumo?!</i>

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:27.460
<i>I've heard about you!</i>

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:32.400
<i>You're the Repo Man of Terror
who collects not just debts, but souls!</i>

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:37.070
It's not quite the "souls"
you'd expect, though...

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:40.410
<i>Wow! You two are friends, Master?!</i>

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:41.930
- Hell, no!

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:41.930
<i>- Hell, no!</i>

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:48.780
Didn't expect to find you here...

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:53.550
What, did you get fired
'cause you screwed up last time?!

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:57.590
<i>Don't worry. I'm just on an errand.</i>

00:13:57.590 --> 00:14:01.100
<i>Anyway, I heard about you, Sunabouzu...</i>

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:02.800
<i>I hear you not only got stranded,</i>

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:07.270
<i>but hired an exceptionally
capable assistant as well?</i>

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:12.470
<i>E-e-eh?! Does "exceptionally
capable assistant" refer to me?!</i>

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.740
Moron!

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:16.580
Why are you here?!

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.420
- Don't act big!

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.420
<i>- Wanna know?</i>

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:25.120
<i>To destroy this Dog-Girl Rock
before you do, obviously.</i>

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:25.860
Eh?!

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:28.860
<i>Don't take it personally!</i>

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:34.100
<i>I owe the landowner, Murahama-san,
for getting me some repo work!</i>

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.650
Why, you!

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:41.800
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:44.770
<i>Master! There's white mist coming out!</i>

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:47.710
Huh? I don't see anything...

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:50.910
<i>T-this is pure bliss!</i>

00:14:57.220 --> 00:15:00.170
What's that dumbass thinking?!

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:06.500
What's with him?!

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.660
<i>It's the curse! The curse!</i>

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:12.100
Don't be dumb! He probably
just ate something bad!

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:16.770
<i>But you saw it, too! The white mist
that came out of that rock!</i>

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:20.780
Why do you keep saying that?!
I didn't see any such thing!

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:21.680
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:24.510
Anyways, that was close!

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:29.880
This jerk almost took off
with the 500,000 yen reward!

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:34.420
Hey! Blast a 40-mm into that...

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:39.260
<i>No! I don't care about the reward, Master!
Let's just go home!</i>

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:42.300
What the hell're you freaking out for?!
Just blast it already!

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.070
<i>No!</i>

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:45.130
Fine! I'll do it!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.400
<i>Master!</i>

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:48.700
Shut up, you chicken!

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:50.870
<i>We're chicken, huh?!</i>

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:52.010
You!

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:53.940
<i>We brothers...</i>

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:55.520
<i>...ain't no...</i>

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:56.510
<i>...chickens.
...chickens.
...chickens.</i>

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.060
You out to steal my thunder too?!

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.800
Hey! What happened?!

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:11.460
<i>N- Natsuko... Forgive your brother...</i>

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:14.560
<i>A girl!</i>

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:18.020
<i>The Dog-Girl's... curse!</i>

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:27.140
<i>No! Let's quit, Master! Let's go home!</i>

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:32.710
<i>I'm sure the curse got them too
on their way here!</i>

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:36.780
That just makes things all the better!

00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:43.830
I'll obliterate this rock

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:47.560
and let the cowards of the world
know once more

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:51.730
just how super-brave and awesome
the great Sunabouzu-sama is!

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:53.360
<i>Master!</i>

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:58.410
What the hell?!

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:01.470
<i>There wasn't a single cloud earlier!</i>

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:05.240
What the?!

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:17.690
<i>Ow...</i>

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:21.470
<i>Darn you, stupid Dog-Girl Rock!</i>

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:25.660
<i>Master?! Where are you, Master?!</i>

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:30.850
<i>That's the white mist I saw earlier!</i>

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:35.070
<i>Master!</i>

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:45.340
Where am I?

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.690
I feel really good!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:59.640
She has a weird dog suit on...

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:02.340
...but she's a babe...

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:04.590
...with mind-boggling boobies!

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:18.990
<i>This is that creepy feeling
I've gotten used to!</i>

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:23.420
<i>C-c-could that black fog be...</i>

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:27.590
<i>...Master's carnal desires?!</i>

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:34.260
<i>Have a drink!</i>

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:42.780
Yum! This is some
top-quality mineral water!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:45.730
<i>I'm glad you like it!</i>

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:53.520
I'd like some of this, too!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.460
<i>No... Don't!</i>

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:58.480
Oh, come, now!

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:07.130
<i>He's fighting that terrible curse
back with his superhuman lust!</i>

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:12.440
<i>Terrifying! It's ugly,
pitch black, and goopy!</i>

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:15.110
<i>Yes, just like sludge!</i>

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:19.010
<i>Eww! Nasty! It's all gooey!</i>

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:25.090
Come back here!

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:28.960
<i>If you want me,
then you'll have to catch me!</i>

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.860
Ok by me!

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:43.370
<i>A battle between grudge and desire!
It's hell!</i>

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:46.770
<i>This is true hell on earth!</i>

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:59.450
Don't worry! I'll treat you
kindly from now on!

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:00.790
<i>W-wait!</i>

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:03.230
Dog-Girl-chan!

00:20:03.230 --> 00:20:04.690
<i>No!</i>

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:07.880
You're all mine!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.690
<i>I'm alive...</i>

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:34.790
<i>Where's Master?!</i>

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:41.150
<i>What're you doing, Master?!</i>

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:45.730
Aw, I was asleep?

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.950
I had such a nice dream!

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:53.030
<i>Dream?! That was a dream?!</i>

00:20:54.510 --> 00:20:56.850
Look at that!

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:58.680
<i>The Dog-Girl Rock!</i>

00:20:58.680 --> 00:21:02.810
I guess it fell down
during that sandstorm...

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:08.860
Fools! Self-defeating yourselves
because of some scary "curse"!

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:14.520
Now do you see how super brave
and awesome I really am?!

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:20.400
Hey! What're you doin'?! Let's go!

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:21.870
<i>Coming!</i>

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:26.740
Now to collect that 500,000!

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:33.720
<i>After that, stories about the curse
of the Dog-Girl Rock died out.</i>

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:38.590
<i>Rumors about the Ghost of the Desert
conquering an evil grudge</i>

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:41.920
<i>spread like wildfire,
and the name "Sunabouzu" echoed</i>

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:45.760
<i>throughout the Great Kanto Desert
once more.</i>

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:59.430
<i>But was that terrifying spectacle
really a dream? If not...</i>

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.540
Hey! What's the hold-up?!

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:11.450
<i>As that would mean Master
is even scarier than the curse,</i>

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:15.910
<i>I try not to think about it anymore.</i>

00:23:55.890 --> 00:23:57.040
<i>Yo! Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here!</i>

00:23:57.040 --> 00:24:00.440
<i>- It sucked.</i>

00:23:57.040 --> 00:24:00.440
<i>- How was Murahama-san's performance?!</i>

00:24:00.440 --> 00:24:01.280
<i>*faceplant*</i>

00:24:01.280 --> 00:24:04.250
<i>Acting is just for show!
Important people wouldn't understand!</i>

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:05.710
<i>But you're important, woof!</i>

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:08.270
<i>On the next Sunabouzu-
"Life and Game"</i>

00:24:08.270 --> 00:24:09.820
<i>Miss it and it's bankruptcy!</i>
